sequenceDiagram
    participant Deploy as deploy.sh<br/>Init Container
    participant OAPI as OpenShift API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS1.2+
    participant Operator as opendatahub Operator
    participant Dashboard as rhods-dashboard<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>9091/TCP HTTPS
    participant ClusterProm as Cluster Prometheus<br/>9091/TCP HTTPS
    participant Components as Platform Components<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant BB as Blackbox Exporter<br/>9115/TCP HTTP
    participant AM as Alertmanager<br/>10443/TCP HTTPS
    participant PD as PagerDuty<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant DMS as Dead Man's Snitch<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant SMTP as SMTP Server<br/>STARTTLS

    Note over Deploy,OAPI: Flow 1: Platform Bootstrap Deployment

    Deploy->>OAPI: Create namespaces (oc new-project)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    OAPI-->>Deploy: Namespace created
    Deploy->>OAPI: Apply KfDef CRs (oc apply)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    OAPI-->>Deploy: KfDef resources created
    Operator->>OAPI: Watch KfDef CRs
    OAPI-->>Operator: KfDef events
    Operator->>OAPI: Deploy platform components<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    Deploy->>OAPI: Apply monitoring manifests<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    Deploy->>OAPI: Apply network policies<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    Deploy->>OAPI: Apply dashboard ISV tiles<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    Deploy->>OAPI: Create ConsoleLink<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token

    Note over Prom,SMTP: Flow 2: Prometheus Monitoring (Managed Service)

    Prom->>ClusterProm: Federation scrape<br/>9091/TCP HTTPS<br/>TLS (service-ca)<br/>Auth: Bearer token (SA)
    ClusterProm-->>Prom: HAProxy, controller_runtime,<br/>kubelet metrics

    Prom->>Components: Scrape /metrics<br/>8080/TCP HTTP<br/>Plaintext<br/>Auth: None
    Components-->>Prom: Controller metrics

    Prom->>BB: Scrape probe results<br/>9115/TCP HTTP<br/>Plaintext
    BB->>Dashboard: HTTP probe<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Auth: Bearer token (SA)
    Dashboard-->>BB: Probe response
    BB-->>Prom: Probe metrics

    Note over AM,SMTP: Alert Routing (Managed Service Only)

    Prom->>AM: Fire alerts<br/>mTLS internal
    AM->>PD: Critical alerts<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS1.2+<br/>Auth: Service key
    AM->>DMS: Watchdog heartbeat<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS1.2+<br/>Auth: Webhook URL
    AM->>SMTP: Email notifications<br/>STARTTLS<br/>Auth: Username/password
